---
import GameLayout from "../components/games/GameLayout.astro";
---

<GameLayout
  title="普莱跳一跳"
  description="按住蓄力，松开起跳。让能量停在绿色区间，陪普莱跳到下一块平台。"
>
  <section class="jump g-section">
    <div class="g-wrap">
      <span class="g-label">普莱跳一跳 · 本地可玩 demo</span><div
        class="jump-lead"
      >
        <h1>轻轻一跃。<br />跳出日常。</h1><p>
          按住蓄力，松开起跳。<br />让能量停在绿色区间，陪普莱跳到下一块平台。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="play-grid">
        <div class="console">
          <header>
            <h3>这次能跳多远？</h3><strong
              ><span id="score">0</span><small>分 · 本地</small></strong>
          </header><div class="jump-board">
            <i class="cloud"></i><div class="pad start">
              <img id="jumper" src="/assets/plai-hero-ice.png" alt="普莱" />
            </div><div class="pad end"><small>下一站</small></div>
          </div><div
            class="charge"
            role="meter"
            aria-label="蓄力"
            aria-valuemin="0"
            aria-valuemax="100"
            aria-valuenow="0"
          >
            <i></i>
          </div>
          <div class="g-actions">
            <button id="charge" class="g-btn primary">按住蓄力，松开跳跃</button
            ><button id="reset" class="g-btn">重新开始</button>
          </div><p class="g-muted">
            也可聚焦按钮后按住空格键，松开起跳。绿色区间为 45–75%，每次成功 +10
            分。
          </p><p id="jump-report" role="status">
            普莱准备好了。试着跳上第一块平台。
          </p>
        </div>
        <aside id="leaderboard">
          <span class="pill">示例榜 · 不是真实玩家</span><h2>
            一起，再跳远一点。
          </h2><div class="best">
            <p>本标签页最好成绩</p><strong id="best">0</strong><p
              id="best-status"
            >
              尚未挑战
            </p>
          </div><ol>
            {
              [120, 90, 60, 30].map((n, i) => (
                <li>
                  <>
                    <span>
                      {i + 1} · 示例玩家 {String.fromCharCode(65 + i)}
                    </span>
                    <b>{n}</b>
                  </>
                </li>
              ))
            }
          </ol><button id="copy" class="g-btn">复制挑战邀请</button><span
            id="copy-status"
            role="status"></span><p class="g-muted">
            仅将本地最好成绩与这份固定示例榜对比。没有联网排名，不上传成绩。
          </p><a href="https://newplay.cryptao.uk/jump.html"
            >打开正式游戏入口 ↗</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</GameLayout>
<script src="../scripts/games/jump.ts"></script>
<style>
  .jump {
    background: #d9f5f2;
    padding-bottom: 100px;
  }
  .jump-lead {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 52px;
  }
  .jump-lead h1 {
    font-size: clamp(46px, 4.2vw, 66px);
  }
  .jump-lead p {
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .play-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.7fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 44px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .console {
    background: #f5fbff;
    border: 1px solid #abcadd;
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 32px;
  }
  .console header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .console h3 {
    font-size: 23px;
  }
  .console header strong {
    font:
      700 42px/1 "NewPlay Space",
      sans-serif;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .console small {
    display: block;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .jump-board {
    position: relative;
    background: #d4e7ff;
    height: clamp(210px, 19.4vw, 290px);
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cloud {
    background: #eef7ff;
    border-radius: 100px;
    width: 25%;
    height: 20%;
    position: absolute;
    right: -2%;
    top: 11%;
  }
  .pad {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 20% 25% 12% 12%;
    width: 14%;
    height: 15%;
    transform: skewY(-4deg);
  }
  .pad.start {
    left: 13%;
    bottom: 11%;
    background: #3685bf;
    box-shadow: 0 10px #185880;
  }
  .pad.end {
    right: 12%;
    bottom: 29%;
    background: #a6d487;
    box-shadow: 0 10px #529956;
  }
  .pad.end small {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 120%;
    right: 10%;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .pad img {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 80%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 150%;
    max-width: 155px;
    height: clamp(115px, 12vw, 175px);
    object-fit: contain;
    mask-image:
      linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #000 8% 92%, transparent),
      linear-gradient(transparent, #000 8% 92%, transparent);
    mask-composite: intersect;
  }
  .charge {
    position: relative;
    height: 17px;
    border: 1px solid #879cb6;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      #dce8f3 45%,
      #99c7a8 45% 75%,
      #dce8f3 75%
    );
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .charge i {
    position: absolute;
    background: #243962;
    height: 100%;
    width: 4px;
    left: var(--power, 0%);
  }
  #charge {
    touch-action: none;
    user-select: none;
    -webkit-user-select: none;
  }
  .console p {
    margin-top: 18px;
  }
  .jump aside {
    padding-top: 28px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .pill {
    font-size: 13px;
    border: 1px solid #537789;
    border-radius: 99px;
    padding: 5px 12px;
  }
  .jump aside h2 {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 2.3vw, 40px);
    margin: 38px 0 28px;
  }
  .best {
    border-block: 1px solid #9abebd;
    padding: 24px 0;
  }
  .best strong {
    font:
      700 56px "NewPlay Space",
      sans-serif;
  }
  .jump ol {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 22px 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .jump li {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #516984;
    padding: 15px 0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .jump aside .g-muted {
    margin: 19px 0;
  }
  .jump aside > a {
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  #copy-status {
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .jump-lead {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 26px;
    }
    .jump-lead p {
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    .play-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
    }
    .console {
      padding: 20px 14px;
    }
    .jump-board {
      height: 230px;
    }
    .pad.start,
    .pad.end {
      width: 24%;
      height: 18%;
    }
    .pad.start {
      bottom: 18%;
    }
    .pad.end {
      bottom: 33%;
    }
    .pad img {
      width: 130px;
      height: 130px;
      bottom: 66%;
    }
    .jump .g-btn {
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .jump aside {
      padding: 0;
    }
    .jump aside h2 {
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .jump {
      padding-bottom: 58px;
    }
  }
</style>
